Third-party test fixtures: Apache Ossie JSON Schemas
====================================================

The two JSON Schema files in this directory are copied unmodified from the Apache Ossie
project (formerly Open Semantic Interchange, OSI), https://github.com/apache/ossie. They are
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; the full text is in LICENSE beside this file.
JSON has no comment syntax, so this file carries their attribution in place of a header.

They are test fixtures only. tests/test_ace173_ossie_export.py validates `sm export --target
ossie` output against them; they are not part of the agami-core package and are not shipped.

  osi-schema-0.1.1.json
    source:  core-spec/osi-schema.json
    tag:     osi-0.1.1-rc1 (commit faf581054dcf7964d5fe0ceae7d6f415c8ce32a5), the 0.1.1 release

